ADO Auditor Business Source License (AA-BSL) – Legal Version

§ 1 Licensor  
The licensor is IT-Titans GmbH, hereinafter referred to as the “Licensor.”

§ 2 Subject Matter of the Agreement  
The subject of this license is the software “ADO Auditor,” including source code, documentation, and all associated files (hereinafter referred to as the “Software”).
The Software is a tool hosted by the Licensor for the security analysis of Azure DevOps organizations. By entering authentication data, it automatically retrieves information about the Azure DevOps organization, evaluates it based on predefined rules, generates recommendations for action, and provides analysis reports (e.g., in PDF format).

